        "**:::**\n",
        "\n",
        "**## Holt-Winters Model**\n",
        "\n",
        "Holt-Winters extends Holt's model by adding a ****seasonal component****.\n",
        "\n",
        "It is therefore useful when the time series contains both:\n",
        "\n",
        "* ↗ ****Trend****  \n",
        "\n",
        "* ↻ ****Seasonality****\n",
        "\n",
        "For quarterly data, one complete seasonal cycle contains ****4 observations****, so:\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\n",
        "s=4\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\n",
        "****The intuition is:****\n",
        "\n",
        "> ****Holt:**** Level + Trend  \n",
        "\n",
        "> ****Holt-Winters:**** Level + Trend + Seasonality\n",
        "\n",
        "**### Example: Holt-Winters Model**\n",
        "\n",
        "**:::{.callout-tip title=\"▸ Coding Session\"}**"
      ],
      "id": "979e158d"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
